<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Northeast Utilities cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Northeast Utilities cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gruntal &amp; Co said it downgraded Northeast Utilities to sell from hold, saying that it saw &quot;limited potential for additional appreciation&quot; in the stock.</p>
<p>-- said in a report Northeast Utilities' future holds &quot;a significant level of uncertainty.&quot;</p>
<p>-- stock was off 1/4 at 9-5/8.</p>
</text>
